<title>USA: Home Depot names division president.</title>
<headline>Home Depot names division president.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Depot Inc said Friday it named Barry Silverman president of its Southwest division, replacing Ken Ubertino, who is leaving the company.</p>
<p>Silverman had been vice president of merchandising for the Northeast division, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
